# Secrets for local CI runs with `act`. Copy this file to `.secrets` (which is
# gitignored) and fill in the value, then run `just act`.
#
# NIX_GITHUB_TOKEN — OPTIONAL. Every flake input is public, so nix does not
# need credentials to fetch them; the token only raises GitHub's anonymous API
# rate limit, which a repeated `act` run can otherwise trip. A fine-grained
# token with no scopes (or a classic PAT with `public_repo`) is enough — `repo`
# scope is not needed. Mint at https://github.com/settings/tokens. Leave blank
# to run anonymously. Mirrors the server-side `secrets.NIX_GITHUB_TOKEN`.
NIX_GITHUB_TOKEN=
